@page
@* @model HomeRealEstate *@

@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home & Real Estate Loans";
}

<section class="section vehicle-hero">
    <div class="container vehicle-hero-grid">
        <div class="vehicle-hero-copy">
            <div class="divider">Home &amp; Real Estate Loans</div>
            <h3>Build, Buy, or Expand Your Dream Property</h3>
            <p>A home is one of the most meaningful investments you will ever make. Whether you are planning to build a house for your family, purchase a residential lot, or renovate your existing home, Rural Bank of Norala is here to make property ownership achievable for our community.</p>
            <p>We offer low-interest, long-term financing solutions tailored for local residents, overseas workers, farmers, and business owners.</p>
            
        </div>
        <div class="home-hero-media">
            <img src="/img/housing_loan.jpeg" alt="Dream Home Financing — Rural Bank of Norala" />
            <a href="/Contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:10px;">Inquire Now</a>
        </div>
        @* <a href="/Contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:10px;">Inquire Now</a> *@
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Real Estate Financing Solutions</div>
        <h3>Credit Support for Every Housing &amp; Land Need</h3>
        <p style="max-width:640px;">We provide credit support for a wide variety of housing and land acquisition needs:</p>

        <table class="data-table" style="margin-top:30px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Loan Purpose</th>
                    <th>Best For</th>
                    <th>Key Benefits</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Home Construction</strong></td>
                    <td>Families building a new house on owned land</td>
                    <td>Stage-by-stage fund releases to match building progress.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Lot Acquisition</strong></td>
                    <td>Individuals buying residential or commercial land</td>
                    <td>Secure affordable land before local property values rise.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>House &amp; Lot Purchase</strong></td>
                    <td>Buyers acquiring existing residential properties</td>
                    <td>Competitive long-term repayment schedules.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Home Renovation &amp; Repair</strong></td>
                    <td>Homeowners expanding or modernizing their homes</td>
                    <td>Flexible loan amounts for roofing, extensions, or repairs.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Why Choose Us</div>
        <h3>Why Choose Rural Bank of Norala?</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:40px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Tailored Repayment Schedules</h3>
                <p>We understand local income sources—whether from agriculture, business, or employment—and structure terms that work for your budget.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Transparent Fees</h3>
                <p>No unexpected penalties or hidden charges; every cost is clearly explained upfront.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Direct Local Assistance</h3>
                <p>Work face-to-face with local credit officers who can guide you through title verification, appraisal, and documentation.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="divider">Requirements &amp; How to Apply</div>
        <h3>Getting Started Is Straightforward</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:40px;">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Basic Requirements</h3>
                <p>To help us process your application smoothly, please prepare:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Valid Government-Issued IDs (Borrower and Spouse/Co-maker)</li>
                    <li>Proof of Income (Pay slips, Certificate of Employment, ITR, Business Permit, or Farm Income records)</li>
                    <li>Property Documents:
                        <ul>
                            <li>Copy of Transfer Certificate of Title (TCT) or Original Certificate of Title (OCT)</li>
                            <li>Latest Tax Declaration &amp; Real Property Tax Receipts</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>Building Plan and Bill of Materials (for Construction Loans)</li>
                    <li>Barangay Clearance &amp; Proof of Billing</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>How to Apply</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li><strong>Inquire:</strong> Visit the Rural Bank of Norala main office or talk to our Account Officers.</li>
                    <li><strong>Property Appraisal:</strong> Submit your property documents so our team can perform a fair appraisal and evaluation.</li>
                    <li><strong>Approval &amp; Disbursal:</strong> Once approved and registered, your loan proceeds will be released according to your project schedule.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>